    <description>8/15/25: SS-11524 - Deprecated at the request of business, as they no longer wish to receive the emailed reminders being sent by the flow.

As Training Implementation Management Team, we would like to have automated emails sent from Training &amp; PS records for Closed/WON opportunities that include Instructor Led Training (ilt/vilt) that have not yet reached “Training End Date”. Our new cancelation policy will note that all trainings will expire 1 year from purchase date. Previously was 90 days.
6/26/23: Added Entry Criteria for NOT({!$Permission.DisableFlows})
7/1/24: SS-8497: Updated the Entry Criteria to exclude WBT</description>
